This repository preserves OpenFOAM-derived source copyright notices and
GPL-3.0-or-later identifiers. The complete existing OpenFOAM/GPL notice is
provided in LICENSE and licenses/OpenFOAM-GPL-3.0.txt.

CoolProp-derived thermophysical correlation code retains its original MIT
notice in licenses/CoolProp-MIT.txt and src/librThermo/LICENSE.CoolProp.
Its provenance is recorded in src/librThermo/PatekNative.provenance.json.

The bundled thermophysical table is generated property data. Its units,
range, model references and limitations are recorded in data/metadata.json
and docs/物性表说明.md.

The repository distributes extension source code and build/documentation
tools for OpenFOAM Foundation 14. Runtime model validation remains the
responsibility of each application using these extensions.
